{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "db78369595b2006e7a051e90d1544ee836c8cf875be6f108dc9f871c3b66fa7d", "ja": "（ひなたの新しい衣装が届いた。なかなか\n可愛いと思うんだけど、本人の反応はどうかな……？）", "zh": "（日向的新服装送来了。\n我觉得相当可爱，不知道她本人反应如何……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "2f6f4a8ae7aa775d08458d49227f14b40574cf064800e40ac484f5a42e8f6346", "ja": "が、がお～……がお～～ん？", "zh": "吼、吼……吼～～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bd14e74a426f6f9ee682f24a4bcf544952c7efdb34de62ee9f3ba4d07dd89e0a", "ja": "ひなた？　なんだか楽しそうだな。", "zh": "日向？你看起来很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "e0d7e07bfa13dbadca91235143c8083e8f8d35f459ae4b6634f02d4acf154a00", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？　{$P$}！\nえへへ……恥ずかしいとこ、見られちゃったべさ。", "zh": "呀啊！？{$P$}！\n嘿嘿……真不好意思，让你看见了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "e081182e7cc9bbb64e105a90d87efc29db17cbce8ccc8048fc591b242fc1baa7", "ja": "でもね、あたし、遊んでたんじゃなくって……\nクマらしく見えるポーズを、研究してたんさ。", "zh": "不过呢，我不是在玩……\n我是在研究怎么摆出像熊一样的姿势哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "82054318beaf0263d094d9770d5e78f8ac3570afdae42d581348957b5bb63cd7", "ja": "亜美シショーと真美センセーに、\nアドバイスをもらったもんでねぇ。", "zh": "亚美师傅和真美老师给了我建议喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ae51a48901b285e233a6e81b7cdd5d2c160fe035db11a345a49012eaef642ba2", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\n亜美と真美がアドバイス……。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。\n亚美和真美的建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "8855e6bc91ad64b937f272e7bc37891d07e2ef54f45843f4ab8845c20d39cc7c", "ja": "そうなんだよぉ。せっかく、\nこったらステキな衣装をもらったもんだから。", "zh": "对啊～\n毕竟难得收到这么棒的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "27a27673aebd381cac9e9bd2c911c7f3223e57d928d3e003d2bf0af70ed6f811", "ja": "お客さんによろこんでもらうには、\nどうしたらいいかなって、相談してみたんだわぁ。", "zh": "为了让观众能看得开心，\n我才会去找她们两位商量该怎么做～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a5b1f66389a78bc8c570556c1f942c46c9fe3f7f130abea5d0c4184db7dacbe1", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれで、ふたりはなんだって？", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以呢？她们俩怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "5cea2896ff704fb3e5f667e9d0123749541e1f497ae6d472111deb7ee7e24d27", "ja": "あのね、『新しい衣装をもらったら、\nまず衣装の魂を感じ取るのじゃ！』って……。", "zh": "那个啊，她们说『拿到新服装之后，\n首先要感受服装的灵魂啊！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "e9880a0253515c4116a1308c2f3bcdd0038d060f330f6216d669b05607e96f9e", "ja": "そうすれば、楽しい気持ちになれるからって。ふふ、\n亜美シショーと真美センセー、いいこと言うねぇ。", "zh": "还说这么做就可以乐在其中了。\n呵呵，亚美师傅和真美老师说得真好哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "39d098c7e20777444302c6cf40211ba82c42104eb62e61abc3b2a52a267726e5", "ja": "（また適当なことを……）", "zh": "（她们又信口胡诌了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "5a50d9cd3d7c60aa3c4c582c6e28e5dca2d0ef442f85f0635b439028b6133e6d", "ja": "この衣装って、クマがモデルなんでしょや？\nだから、クマっぽくしてみようと思ったんだけども。", "zh": "这套服装的主题是熊对不对？\n所以，我才会想试着模仿熊哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "4ddcdcd91cfec31807a4a0507014353b94bb2e9697bc301749d8865e0bbe0f8f", "ja": "なかなか難しくてねぇ……。\n{$P$}、アドバイスくれるかい？", "zh": "但是真的好难喔……\n{$P$}，你愿意给我一点建议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2ffe596ff9695d7388a4002de3c1f178fc8f7424e41972dae0f7a09d5c0cb093", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。でもクマっぽさに、\nそんなにこだわらなくていいんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "唔～嗯，我想想……\n不过，我觉得应该没有必要执着在模仿熊这件事上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "04988fa57fec847418c165433d47ca64c95c198895dafc7054779204dce9f86a", "ja": "ええっ！？　でもそれだと、\n衣装の魂が感じ取れないんじゃないかい……？", "zh": "咦！？但是这样的话，\n不会感受不到服装的灵魂吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "96afbd9e8ba910647e8f52544dd5621a132a91c2882f73204407cb59b8c627a9", "ja": "亜美と真美は、そうすれば\n楽しい気持ちになれるって言ったんだろ？", "zh": "亚美和真美她们不是说，\n这么做可以乐在其中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "033ae029d98fe59fcd8c0ea6e6c6779952ef1ef31b44934f834aeed15fa88b51", "ja": "なら……ふたりはひなたに、楽しい気持ちで\nステージに上がって欲しかっただけなんじゃないかな。", "zh": "那么……我想她们俩的意思，\n应该只是希望日向上台表演时能够乐在其中吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "7a11856260e6d7c6e98d59cf1e7aaa54289249e6fd0b585b173763bb917b65a0", "ja": "ふわぁ……！　そういうことだったのかい……。\n{$P$}、教えてくれてありがとねぇ。", "zh": "呜哇……！原来是这么一回事吗……\n{$P$}，谢谢你告诉我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "01dea28857cfa88609641d66775e25672f5ad13e4008bf5b4ab13f9fbb684641", "ja": "あたし、亜美シショーと真美センセーの\n本当の気持ち、ちっともわかってなかったよぉ。", "zh": "我一点都没听出亚美师傅和真美老师\n真正想告诉我的事情哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "07e2fbe03844db457b1cb7253745e3e488491eef08a4fbc1a6b5fde983e79c81", "ja": "どうだ？　ひなた。\n楽しい気持ちで、ステージやれそうか？", "zh": "怎么样，日向？\n你上台表演时有办法乐在其中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "d51f188f55e87b4ca7302035c4b0c4006e7e1e3ca3855d1a9e14bea54e6e5fdf", "ja": "うん。なんもなんも、心配いらないよぉ。\nこの衣装を着てるとね、自然と笑顔になるんだべさ！", "zh": "嗯，这不算什么，不用担心喔～\n只要穿上这套服装，我就自然会露出笑容哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "7e22f24f25313a294597ab2e7deb4ef8fb682d66b1cbb010642f70a7c9193122", "ja": "亜美シショーと真美センセー、それから\n{$P$}にもらった気持ち……。", "zh": "亚美师傅、真美老师，\n还有{$P$}的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0084_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "c9eaaafaa759ed07b1b867614a98694fcf35ef4dd36dc6f2ed6430434ae3f37c", "ja": "ステージでみんなに、おすそわけするべさ♪\n見ててねぇ、{$P$}！", "zh": "我会在舞台上分享给大家哪♪\n要看好啰～{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
